      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like im just stuck in this loop. wake up, clock in, scan boxes, clock out, sleep. repeat. it's like i don't even exist as a person anymore, im just a part of the machine. if i stopped tomorrow, they'd just hire someone else and not even notice. there's no point to any of it.",
