    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "a walk isnt gonna change anything. the machine is still there when i get back. it feels like no matter what i do, the system just absorbs it. like, even taking a walk is just something i do so i can go back and do the same shit tomorrow. it feels less like \"agency\" and more like just... delaying the inevitable. everything is so heavy and meaningless, i just want it to stop being like this forever.",
